Sara, take it from me- you really want to have the audio for the items
before you make them- going back through and putting the audio in afterwards
is a huge pain in the butt. Literally and figuratively, for me. It took me
about four hours to do the entries, about 45 minutes to make the audio, and-
so far- two 5 hour sessions (yesterday and currently) to add the audio to
the entries. In the future, I am going to make the audio bits FIRST, and
then make the entries, and save myself a hell of a lot of work.

